 the runtime/UI paths inspected and the remaining missing posture-map integration field.\n\n## Boundaries\n- No broad frontend refactor.\n- No visual, VLM, rights approval, SourceFigureAsset acceptance, official scoring, rubric-ready, launch-ready, Supabase mutation, or Phase B2 eligibility work.\n- Existing legacy context packets without `evidence_availability_status` keep neutral copy unless they contain official-certainty claims; future #1169/#1170 posture maps can wire the status fields into the existing boundary.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/copilot-evidence-wording-gate.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/paper-workspace-pr4a-v1-adapter.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/paper-workspace-copilot-drawer-contract.test.js` passed: 29 tests.\n- `npm run test:w6:paper-workspace` passed on isolated rerun: 16 tests; Jest emitted the existing open-handle warning after completion but exited 0. One prior chained run hit a transient characterization `beforeAll` timeout, then passed immediately when rerun alone.\n- `npx eslint src/pages/paper-workspace/runtime/v1-student-adapter.js src/pages/paper-workspace/runtime/copilot-evidence-wording-gate.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/paper-workspace-pr4a-v1-adapter.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/copilot-evidence-wording-gate.test.js` passed.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed with expected dirty-worktree warning before the review-fix commit; committed worktree will be rechecked clean after push.\n\nCloses #1163","created_at":"2026-07-02T11:06:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T11:42:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T11:42:48Z","merged_at":"2026-07-02T11:42:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"af0e8497b2715ea90597fae60121833142eb5462","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopil